  "description": "Driver-neutral abstraction for the control channel to a radio: RSSI, hardware carrier-sense (DCD) events, transmitter keying (IRadioControl), and a radio-native small-datagram control plane (IRadioSideChannel). Includes RigRadioControl, which presents any M0LTE.Rig CAT rig through the same seam. Concrete drivers plug in underneath (e.g. M0LTE.Radio.Tait). Source: github.com/M0LTE/M0LTE.Radio.",
